    "detailed_description": "After School is a short visual novel about an elementary school student who encounters an injured old woman on her way home from school, who begs her to help her walk home, and thus begins a frightening adventure...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is presented in a cute cartoon style, describing a bloody social case, and skillfully integrating monsters from folk tales to enhance the story tension. A dilapidated old house, a set of poor children's souls waiting for you to release.<br />\r\nFacing the inhuman old woman in front of you, what horrible secrets are hidden behind her?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to play: *The story progresses through the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*The story progresses mainly by mouse clicks.<br />\r\n*The fighting system uses the arrow keys for fun dodging and avoidance.<br />\r\n*Automatic archiving mechanism.",
